Own the display only while a video renderer is active.

Defer DRM initialization until playback. Both HLS and mirroring acquire through
the renderer, stop every remaining codec candidate, then release synchronously.
Spawn the configured helper with argv so paths never pass through a shell.
Serialize start/stop transitions and leave arbitration policy to the helper.

